  - the two changed pins;
  - rung W's `ComponentWrapper.java` edit;
  - rung N's unreported `Functionals.scala` edit;
  - the cold read's items `coldread.1` to `coldread.6` and the review's `review.N` items. The skill sentences are being fixed by the skill writer now; say so.
